      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think I might have figured out why the vrc mobile mic being so bad sometimes, and it has to do with upload speed. I had the same issue with my Quest less night while on wifi. My upload speed was so load that others said my mic was breaking badly.  I also timed out a lot. I did speed tests on my PC and phone. Speed on phone and wifi were below 5.0 Mbps for upload. The wifi has been fixed and upload speed is sitting at 9.88 to 17 Mbps and is clear on my Quest.",
